# Project-Specific Data (CONFIDENTIAL - DO NOT COMMIT)
# Every real/sample client project folder - source documents, transcripts,
# pipeline intermediates (workflow_execution/), and generated HTML/PPTX
# reports - stays local only, never in git. The actual folder in this repo
# is "Projects/" (capital P); "projects/" is kept too in case that changes.
Projects/*/
projects/*/

# Keep a template project skeleton and examples, if present
!Projects/_template_project/
!projects/_template_project/
!examples/

# Real client sample data and its generated outputs - not for git
sample_data/
output/

